@startuml dashboard_owned_packaging
participant Operator
participant "repack.py" as Recipe
participant "Pinned upstream tarball" as Original
participant "Owned tarball + provenance" as Artifact
Operator -> Recipe : build / upstream bytes
Recipe -> Original : verify exact SHA512 / SHA1; bounded data read
Original --> Recipe : regular-file payload
Recipe -> Recipe : change only name/version/CSS value
Recipe -> Artifact : deterministic gzip/tar + complete payload hashes
Operator -> Recipe : verify
Recipe -> Artifact : compare complete expected bytes and invariants
Artifact --> Operator : artifact qualification only; app integration open
@enduml
